\texloomfield{abstract}{This report presents a low-cost soil-moisture-driven irrigation controller for small farms. The system combines capacitive moisture probes, a water-balance model and long-range radio to water only when needed.\par In a four-week field trial the prototype cut water use by 34\% compared with a fixed timer, at a cost of under \$60 per zone.}
