\chapter{Conclusion}\label{tl:h-conclusion}

The prototype reduced water use by 34\% over a four-week field trial while keeping soil moisture within the target band. Future work includes weather-forecast integration and a mobile dashboard.

\texloombibliography

\texloomappendix

\chapter{Design Criteria}\label{tl:h-design-criteria}

The controller had to meet these criteria, agreed with the project sponsor at the start of the semester:

\begin{itemize}
\item Run for 12 months on solar power without maintenance.
\item Report soil moisture at least every 15 minutes.
\item Survive outdoor temperatures from −5 °C to 50 °C.
\end{itemize}

